<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>
    <%= title %>
  </title>
  <meta name="description" content="<%= description %>">
  <meta property="og:title" content="<%= title %>">
  <meta property="og:description" content="<%= description %>">
  <meta property="og:type" content="website">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/main.css">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/our-partners.css">
</head>

<body>
  <%- include('partials/header') %>

    <main id="main-content">

      <div class="page-intro">
        <div class="container">
          <span class="eyebrow">Our Partners</span>
          <h1>Our Partners</h1>
          <p class="lead">Our Scope is the supply and Installation of all types of furniture (e.g.: Hotels & Restaurant
            Furniture, Hospitals & Laboratory Furniture, Office furniture, Control rooms Furniture, etc...).</p>
          <p class="lead" style="margin-top: 15px;">We represent many European Manufacturers in the Egyptian Market
            which we can brief below:</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Categories -->
      <section class="coll-list" aria-labelledby="categories-heading">
        <h2 id="categories-heading" class="sr-only">Our Partners</h2>

        <div class="coll-item" id="hotel-residential">
          <a href="/partners/able" class="coll-item__img-col slider-img-col" aria-label="View ABLE partner details">
            <img src="/images/partners-projects/able-hospitality-project.png" alt="Luxury hotel and residential furniture by ABLE" class="coll-item__img slider-img-1">
            <img src="/images/partners-projects/able-residential-project.png" alt="Luxury hotel and residential furniture by ABLE" class="coll-item__img slider-img-2">
          </a>
          <div class="coll-item__content-col">
            <span class="coll-item__num"></span>
            <h3>Hotel & Residential High-End Furniture</h3>
            <p class="coll-item__partner" style="margin-bottom: 20px;"><strong>Partner:</strong> ABLE</p>
            <p>Able (formerly VIP SALOTI) is the largest Furniture Manufacturer and Brand specializing in contemporary
              furniture design in Eastern Europe with more than 30 years of experience in the industry, and a reflection
              of the best of Albania.</p>
            <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top: 20px;">
              <a href="/partners/able" class="btn btn--outline" id="partner-able-readmore">Read More</a>
              <a href="https://ablebemodern.com/" class="btn btn--dark" id="partner-able-link" target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit Website</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="coll-item coll-item--reverse" id="office-zivella">
          <a href="/partners/zivella" class="coll-item__img-col" aria-label="View Zivella partner details">
            <img src="\images\partners-projects\zivella-project.png" alt="Office Furniture by Zivella"
              class="coll-item__img">
          </a>
          <div class="coll-item__content-col">
            <span class="coll-item__num"></span>
            <h3>Office Furniture</h3>
            <p class="coll-item__partner" style="margin-bottom: 20px;"><strong>Partner:</strong> Zivella Office
              Furniture</p>
            <p>Approximately 25 years ago, Located in Istanbul, our factory exports to nearly 50 countries with our team
              of 250 specialized employees.</p>
            <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top: 20px;">
              <a href="/partners/zivella" class="btn btn--outline" id="partner-zivella-readmore">Read More</a>
              <a href="https://www.zivella.com/" class="btn btn--dark" id="partner-zivella-link" target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit Website</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="coll-item" id="office-falmar">
          <a href="/partners/falmar" class="coll-item__img-col slider-img-col" aria-label="View Falmar partner details">
            <img src="/images/partners-projects/falmar-project1.png" alt="Office Partitions and Furniture by Falmar"
              class="coll-item__img slider-img-1">
            <img src="/images/partners-projects/falmar-project2.png" alt="Office Partitions and Furniture by Falmar"
              class="coll-item__img slider-img-2">
          </a>
          <div class="coll-item__content-col">
            <span class="coll-item__num"></span>
            <h3>Office Furniture & Partitions</h3>
            <p class="coll-item__partner" style="margin-bottom: 20px;"><strong>Partner:</strong> Falmar Office Furniture
            </p>
            <p>Falmar based in Pesaro, Italy established in 1990 as manufacturer of Wall Partitions, storage walls and
              office furniture. The company owns a factory laying on 6000 sqm takes care of the full production process.
            </p>
            <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top: 20px;">
              <a href="/partners/falmar" class="btn btn--outline" id="partner-falmar-readmore">Read More</a>
              <a href="https://falmar.it/" class="btn btn--dark" id="partner-falmar-link" target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit Website</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="coll-item coll-item--reverse" id="control-rooms">
          <a href="/partners/bosco" class="coll-item__img-col" aria-label="View Bosco partner details">
            <img src="\images\partners-projects\bosco-project.png" alt="Control Room Furniture by Bosco"
              class="coll-item__img">
          </a>
          <div class="coll-item__content-col">
            <span class="coll-item__num"></span>
            <h3>Control Rooms Furniture</h3>
            <p class="coll-item__partner" style="margin-bottom: 20px;"><strong>Partner:</strong> Elettromeccanica Bosco
              SNC</p>
            <p>BOSCO is a pioneer in designing and delivering high tech control room solutions. Our technical and
              ergonomical furniture includes control consoles and video wall systems.</p>
            <div class="btn-row" style="margin-top: 20px;">
              <a href="/partners/bosco" class="btn btn--outline" id="partner-bosco-readmore">Read More</a>
              <a href="https://www.elettrobosco.com/en/" class="btn btn--dark" id="partner-bosco-link" target="_blank"
                rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit Website</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="coll-item" id="healthcare">
          <div class="coll-item__img-col">
            <img src="/images/healthcare.png" alt="Health Care & Laboratories Furniture" class="coll-item__img">
          </div>
          <div class="coll-item__content-col">
            <span class="coll-item__num"></span>
            <h3>Health Care & Laboratories Furniture</h3>
            <p style="color: #d32f2f; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;">(Under
              Construction)</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="coll-item coll-item--reverse" id="airport-furniture">
          <div class="coll-item__img-col">
            <div class="coll-item__img-placeholder" style="background: #8E8B83;" role="img"
              aria-label="Airports Furniture"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="coll-item__content-col">
            <span class="coll-item__num"></span>
            <h3>Airports Furniture</h3>
            <p style="color: #d32f2f; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;">(Under
              Construction)</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="coll-item" id="airport-equipment">
          <div class="coll-item__img-col">
            <div class="coll-item__img-placeholder" style="background: #6B6963;" role="img"
              aria-label="Airports Equipment"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="coll-item__content-col">
            <span class="coll-item__num"></span>
            <h3>Airports Equipment</h3>
            <p style="color: #d32f2f; font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;">(Under
              Construction)</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </section>

      <!-- CTA -->
      <section class="cta-band" aria-labelledby="collections-cta-heading">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="cta-band__inner">
            <div class="cta-band__left">
              <h2 id="collections-cta-heading">Need a Specific<br>Solution?</h2>
            </div>
            <div class="cta-band__right">
              <p>Tell us about your project requirements. Our team will provide a detailed proposal including product
                specifications, pricing, and delivery timelines.</p>
              <div class="btn-row">
                <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--accent" id="collections-cta-contact">Contact Us</a>
                <a href="/projects" class="btn btn--ghost" id="collections-cta-projects">View Our Projects</a>
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

    </main>

    <%- include('partials/footer') %>
      <%- include('partials/cookie-consent') %>
        <script src="/js/main.js"></script>
</body>

</html>